<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-RUSSIAN PREMIER DIVISION RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RUSSIAN PREMIER DIVISION RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of final Russian premier</p>
<p>league matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p> Torpedo Moscow		  2    Dynamo Moscow		   5</p>
<p> Rostselmash Rostov	    4    KamAZ Naberezhniye Chelny   5</p>
<p> Zenit St Petersburg	   1    Spartak Moscow		  2</p>
<p> Zhemchuzhina Sochi	    2    Krylya Sovetov Samara	 2</p>
<p> Alania Vladikavkaz	    3    Lokomotiv Nizhny Novgorod   1</p>
<p> Chernomorets Novorossiisk   4    Lada Togliatti		  1</p>
<p> Baltika Kaliningrad	   4    Tekstilshchik Kamyshin	1</p>
<p> Lokomotiv Moscow		1    CSKA Moscow		     2</p>
<p> Rotor Volgograd		 2    Uralmash Yekaterinburg	1</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under games played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, goals against, points).</p>
<p>Note - If more than one team has the same number of points,</p>
<p>precedence is given to the one with most wins. If more than one</p>
<p>team has the same number of points and wins, precedence goes to</p>
<p>the side with the better record against the other.</p>
<p>However, if teams are level on points after all games have</p>
<p>been played and the championship or relegation is at stake, the</p>
<p>teams involved must play a deciding play-off or play-offs.</p>
<p> Alania Vladikavkaz	   34   22   6   6   64   35   72</p>
<p> Spartak Moscow		 34   21   9   4   70   34   72</p>
<p> Rotor Volgograd		34   21   7   6   58   27   70</p>
<p> Dynamo Moscow		  34   20   7   7   60   35   67</p>
<p> CSKA Moscow		    34   20   6   8   58   35   66</p>
<p> Lokomotiv Moscow	     34   15  10   9   46   31   55</p>
<p> Baltika Kaliningrad	  34   12  10  12   44   35   46</p>
<p> Lokomotiv Nizhny Novgorod  34   13   6  15   39   50   45</p>
<p> Krylya Sovetov Samara	34   12   9  13   31   38   45</p>
<p> Zenit St Petersburg	  34   13   4  17   32   37   43</p>
<p> Rostselmash Rostov	   34   11   8  15   58   60   41</p>
<p> Torpedo Moscow		 34   10  11  13   42   51   41</p>
<p> Chernomorets Novorossiisk  34   11   6  17   38   51   39</p>
<p> KamAz Naberezhniye Chelny  34   10   6  18   43   57   36</p>
<p> Zhemchuzhina Sochi	   34   10   6  18   38   57   36</p>
<p> Uralmash Yekaterinburg     34    8   9  17   38   57   33</p>
<p> Tekstilshchik Kamyshin     34    4  12  18   25   48   24</p>
<p> Lada Togliatti		 34    4   6  24   18   64   18</p>
<p>Alania Vladikavkaz and Spartak Moscow will play off for the</p>
<p>championship at a date and venue to be decided.</p>
<p>Uralmash Yekaterinburg, Tekstilshchik Kamyshin and Lada</p>
<p>Togliatti are relegated.</p>
